Place the exported ONNX model here, alongside its tokenizer files:

    model.onnx
    config.json          <- must contain id2label; the server reads it
    tokenizer.json / vocab.txt
    tokenizer_config.json
    special_tokens_map.json

Produced by the export cell in training/benchmark/ or training/order/.
The server reads its label inventory from config.json, so no code change
is needed when swapping domains.
